<h3>What this checks</h3>

This tool compares presenting values against the American Diabetes
Association criteria for diabetic ketoacidosis, and reports which criteria
are met.

<h3>Interpretation</h3>

Meeting three or more criteria is flagged as suggestive of a severe
presentation. This is a reference aid only — clinical judgement and
immediate assessment take precedence.
